Package: cloudimg-diff
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${python3:Depends},
Description: compare package manifests of Ubuntu cloud image builds
 cloudimg-diff downloads the package manifests that are published next to
 every Ubuntu cloud image and shows which packages were upgraded,
 downgraded, added or removed between two builds.
 .
 It can also compare the packages installed on the running machine with
 the image it was launched from, which helps spot configuration drift.
 Version comparison follows the same rules as dpkg.
